message.content:
This comment is incorrect:
// After a fetch, go-git's storer cache may be stale (new packfiles on disk
// are invisible to the repo opened before the fetch). To avoid this, each
// attempt opens a fresh repo after the fetch succeeds.

There is no such a thing as "storer cache" that gets stale even when new changes take place at the object store. Please remove this comment and any code changes that lean on that assumption.

